      "writtenOn": "2025-05-07T10:18:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: instead of binding the uniform buffer after the textures, maybe we should bind it at index\u003d0, and bind all textures starting from 1. It would make the code easier to read.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 86,
        "startChar": 10,
