        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-07T10:18:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider using `device-\u003eGetOrCreateTemporaryUniformBuffer` for buffer reuses.\n\nFor `GetOrCreateTemporaryUniformBuffer`, we should use 4 integers for buffer size to avoid the device creating another buffer. Because many other workarounds also use 4 integers in uniform buffer.\n\n```\n            DAWN_TRY_ASSIGN(paramsBuffer,\n                            device-\u003eGetOrCreateTemporaryUniformBuffer(sizeof(int32_t) * 4));\n\n            int32_t params[4];\n            params[0] \u003d resolveRect-\u003eresolveOffsetX - resolveRect-\u003ecolorOffsetX;\n            params[1] \u003d resolveRect-\u003eresolveOffsetY - resolveRect-\u003ecolorOffsetY;\n            params[2] \u003d 0; // unused\n            params[3] \u003d 0; // unused\n            commandEncoder-\u003eAPIWriteBuffer(paramsBuffer.Get(), 0,\n                                           reinterpret_cast\u003cconst uint8_t*\u003e(\u0026params[0]),\n                                           sizeof(params));\n```\n\nYou can see an example here https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/BlitBufferToTexture.cpp;drc\u003d81e4ab4dec47df836df1975d9ba09b1caa0f38fb;l\u003d456",
      "revId": "51c8c60d89081e49c0683ea31ae7631f67c5844f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
